  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Final Answer Key 2025</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-09-24T13:41:33+05:30\">September 24, 2025</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">1:41 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</a>,</strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has been announced the <strong>Final</strong> <strong>Answer Key</strong>\u00a0for the <strong>Assistant Engineer (AE)</strong> Recruitment 2025. The preliminary examination is scheduled to be held from <strong>17, 18 &amp; 19 July 2025</strong>. This recruitment drive aims to fill <strong>1040 AE vacancies</strong> across Civil, Mechanical, and Electrical disciplines. The application process for this recruitment was open from <strong>30th April to 28th May 2025</strong><strong>.</strong> Candidates must check the complete details for the <strong>Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Final Answer Key 2025</strong>\u00a0provided below.</span></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            background-color: #25D366;\n        }\n        .whatsapp:hover {\n            background-color: #1EBE57;\n        }\n        .telegram {\n            background-color: #0088cc;\n        }\n        .telegram:hover {\n            background-color: #0078b8;\n        }\n        .icon {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n    </style></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> Telegram </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Final Answer Key 2025 \u2013 Out</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bpsc-assistant-engineer-ae-final-answer-key-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>30 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>28 May 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>28 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong> 17, 18, &amp; 19 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :\u00a0<strong>14 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer Key : 24 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key Objection :\u00a0<strong>01-08 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>Bihar</strong>\u00a0<strong>BPSC</strong> official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">For<strong> General/ OBC/ EWS </strong>: <strong>\u20b9 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ PH</strong>\u00a0: <strong>\u20b9 200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">For <strong>All Category Female Of Bihar</strong> : <strong>\u20b9 200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Objection Charge :\u00a0<strong>Rs.250/- Per Question</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 August 2025</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :\u00a0<strong>21 Yrs</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>37 Yrs. (Male)\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>40 Yrs (Female UR, BC/ EBC-Male &amp; Female)\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>42 Yrs (SC/ ST-Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar BPSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>Assistant Engineer AE\u00a0</strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">1040 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"99ef65d1749abc161429dc76-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"99ef65d1749abc161429dc76-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-976266268732