ical</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6594%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">36 Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0847%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>BE</strong> or <strong>B.Tech</strong> degree in <strong>Mechanical Engineering</strong> from a recognized university or institute. This qualification is necessary to apply for the relevant post or examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 17.2558%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">AE Electrical</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6594%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">20 Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0847%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>BE</strong> or <strong>B.Tech</strong> degree in <strong>Electrical Engineering</strong> from a recognized university or institute. This qualification is required to be eligible for the respective post or recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <strong><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/niacl-assistants-online-form-2024/\">NIACL Assistants Online Form 2024</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; Download Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Answer Key 2025\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 1