;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Final Answer Key 2025</span>\u00a0: Important Question\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When was the <strong>Final Answer Key</strong> released?</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> The <strong data-end=\"302\" data-start=\"277\">Final Answer Key 2025</strong> for BPSC AE has been released after reviewing objections submitted on the provisional key.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Where can I check the <strong>Final Answer Key?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> On the <strong data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"458\">BPSC official website</strong>, under the <em data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"495\">Answer Key / Notices</em> section.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What is the format of the <strong>Final Answer Key?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> It is published in <strong data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"607\">PDF format</strong>, containing the correct answers for all question papers/sets.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Why is the <strong>Final Answer Key</strong> important?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: Because the result will be prepared strictly on the basis of the Final Answer Key, and no further changes will be accepted.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bihar BPSC</strong></span>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bihar BPSC </strong></span>is https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Bihar BPSC Assistant Engineer AE Answer Key 2025\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-21821\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/hq720-17-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/hq720-17-1.jpg 686w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/hq720-17-1-300x169.jpg 300w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headlin